<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARY IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARY IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of the game played in the Spanish first division on Monday. Barcelona 3 (Giovanni 13th, Gheorghe Popescu 40th, Juanito Rodriguez 45th) Extremadura 0. Halftime 3-0. Attendance 70,000.</p>
